      "content": "it's not just about needing a sleep or a break. it's the feeling that nothing i do actually matters. i see the same faces, the same tragedy, over and over. it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable for people who are just gonna suffer more anyway. like... what is the point of even fighting it?",
